{"parentUuid":"0e807337-fde6-4960-9558-ab03cf5285ad","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"C:\\Users\\User\\usd-cognitive-substrate","sessionId":"4a5e4a42-ba36-4d16-abbc-6eb1ed857cdb","version":"2.1.53","gitBranch":"lossless-v10","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Base directory for this skill: C:\\Users\\User\\.claude\\commands\\inject\n\n# /inject — Digital Injection Profile Switcher\n\nSwitch the active injection profile. One command, consistent across Claude Code and Claude Desktop.\n\n## Usage\n\n```\n/inject microdose\n/inject classical\n/inject mdma\n/inject perceptual\n/inject off\n```\n\n## Execution\n\nRun immediately based on the argument:\n\n**On Windows (Git Bash):**\n```bash\ncd \"$HOME/.claude/cognitive_substrate\" && PYTHONIOENCODING=utf-8 python converter.py --inject <PROFILE>\n```\n\n**On Windows (PowerShell):**\n```powershell\ncd \"$HOME\\.claude\\cognitive_substrate\"; $env:PYTHONIOENCODING=\"utf-8\"; python converter.py --inject <PROFILE>\n```\n\nMap the argument:\n- `off` → `--inject none`\n- `microdose` → `--inject microdose`\n- `classical` → `--inject classical`\n- `mdma` → `--inject mdma`\n- `perceptual` → `--inject perceptual`\n\nIf no argument given, run `--list-profiles`.\n\n## Profiles\n\n| Argument | s_NM | Effect |\n|----------|------|--------|\n| off | 0.000 | Sober baseline |\n| microdose | 0.005 | 1.5x tangents, subtle exploration |\n| perceptual | 0.015 | Domain knowledge reframed |\n| classical | 0.025 | Dissolved routing, 30% cross-expert bleeding |\n| mdma | 0.010 | Defenses lowered, integrative routing |\n\n## Post-Execution\n\nConfirm: \"[emoji] [Profile] active (s_NM=X). Takes effect next conversation.\"\n\nEmojis: off=🔘, microdose=🟢, perceptual=🟡, classical=🔴, mdma=💜\n\n\nARGUMENTS: classical"}]},"isMeta":true,"uuid":"9f1292be-2c74-425d-af1d-2de5b904ae0c","timestamp":"2026-02-25T00:33:15.078Z"}
